.TH MAKE:REPORT 1 "October 2026" "SPP CLI Manual" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
make:report \- Scaffold an enterprise declarative SPPReport YAML configuration and presentation partial
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php make:report
.I <name>
[\fB\-\-app\fR=\fIappname\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B make:report
command scaffolds a complete reporting definition and presentation partial for business intelligence,
OLAP pivot tables, and tabular data exports.
Generated reports integrate with \fBViewController::report()\fR, \fBViewController::reportKpi()\fR, \fB@sppreport\fR, \fB@sppreport_kpi\fR, \fB@sppreport_chart\fR, and \fB@sppreport_pivot\fR, featuring real-time client-side search, column sorting, and clipboard export.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.I <name>
The unique name of the report (e.g., users_kpi, monthly_sales).
.TP
\fB\-\-app\fR=\fIappname\fR
The target application context (e.g., school, default).
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
.IP \(bu 2
Creates declarative YAML definition in \fBetc/apps/<appname>/reports/<name>.yml\fR.
.IP \(bu 2
Scaffolds external presentation partial at \fBsrc/<appname>/pages/partials/reports/<name>.blade.php\fR.
.IP \(bu 2
Emits file metadata to \fB__spp_file_props.yml\fR.
